node_modules/
dist/

# Not committed on purpose. The one devDependency (@resvg/resvg-js) is used only
# by scripts/generate-icons.mjs, which a maintainer runs by hand when the brand
# mark changes; the committed PNGs are the artifact. scripts/build.mjs - the only
# thing that produces a release - has zero dependencies and never reads this
# file, so a lockfile could not affect what ships.
package-lock.json

# Local agent instructions, deliberately not published. CLAUDE.md is the maintainer's
# working notes for this repository, not something this repository promises its
# readers - those promises are README.md, SECURITY.md and PRIVACY.md, and
# scripts/audit.mjs is what keeps them true. Claude Code reads it from disk rather
# than from git, so ignoring it costs nothing. Do not re-add it.
CLAUDE.md

# macOS
.DS_Store
